  Stop letting AutoFix burn cycles on flakes.
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Install the Kleore GitHub App. Get a ranked list of every flaky test in your repos — with dollar costs attached — in two minutes. Free to start.&lt;/p&gt;

